text Once work is done, I get in the passenger seat of the car.
text Next to me, Yoshino-san is excitedly looking at something as he holds the camera.
text I look over to see that there's a small monitor on the camera, and that he's checking the photos he just took.
text @[Tomoya]
text Is that one of those digital cameras?
sound MN2.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Yeah. What, is this your first time seeing one of these too?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah.
sound MN3.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Here.
text He hands it to me.
sound MN4.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text You simply press this button and you can see the photos you just took.
text I try doing as he explains.
text On the LCD monitor, I see images of things that were written on our work schedule, such as a blackboard with the work performed written on it, varnished tubes with a ruler next to them, and more.
text @[Tomoya]
text Do you not use normal cameras anymore?
sound MN5.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Well, we can also use disposable cameras, but digital ones are just so much cheaper.
text @[Tomoya]
text Really?
text Part of me is surprised, but I also feel a tinge of sadness.
text It was the same way with his phone.
text When I was a student, the world where people used these kinds of devices was invisible to me.
text Before I could notice, they had spread and changed the look of the outside world.
sound MN6.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Hey, what's wrong?
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh?
sound MN7.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text You thinking about something?
text I must have been engrossed in my thoughts for a second or two.
text @[Tomoya]
text No...
text But I can't see the existence of these machines as negatives. They're helping me out with my own work, after all.
text @[Tomoya]
text So, what are you going to do with those photos?
text I force myself to sound as cheerful as possible.
sound MN8.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text We'll submit them to our primary contractor later.
text @[Tomoya]
text What about after that?
sound MN9.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Who knows. We'll probably save them somewhere.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yoshino-san.
sound MNA.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text What is it?
text *Snap*
text I wait for Yoshino-san to turn around and take a shot of him when he does.
text It must be dark out, because the flash goes off on its own, and it looks like a flash of lightning.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Oh, that must've surprised you.
text The photo perfectly captures Yoshino-san's shocked face.
sound MNB.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text ...Hey.
text @[Tomoya]
text Sorry. I was hoping to surprise you, but not that much.
sound MNC.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text No, it's fine.
text Yoshino-san suddenly grabs the camera out of my hands.
sound MND.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text So, what kind of embarrassing photo do you want taken of you?
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh?
sound MNE.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text You took a picture of me without asking, so I get to take one of you. Got a problem with that?
text I have a bad feeling about this.
sound MNF.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Answer me.
text @[Tomoya]
text N-No, I don't.
